{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire",
    "description": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is an amazing classic spider solitaire not only has very smooth basic spider solitaire game play, but also has spider solitaire journey, spider solitaire jigsaw, spider solitaire makeup, and other interesting game play. You can focus on playing the classic spider solitaire card games, and when you need some freshness in classic spider solitaire card games you can play this creative solitaire journey, solitaire jigsaw, solitaire makeup, and so on. Spider Solitaire is also the best classic solitaire card game to sharp your mind and train your brain, like Klondike solitaire, TriPeaks solitaire, Pyramid solitaire, FreeCell solitaire, and so on. Playing Spider Solitaire keeps your brain doing exercise, like your body doing sport, which makes your brain more energetic and younger.\r\n\r\n<b>Spider solitaire journey</b>: The journey will bring you to many countries to enjoy the beautiful sceneries. When you play some spider solitaire card games in this solitaire journey, the journey will bring you to a different place with beautiful scenery. You can go to Europe, America, and so on. Each deal of the spider solitaire card games in this solitaire journey feature has a goal, when you finish the goal you win this deal. The spider deals with goals are really interesting.\r\n<b>Spider solitaire jigsaw</b>: play spider solitaire card games to collect jigsaw fragments, and then you will collect many beautiful pieces and pictures.\r\n<b>Spider solitaire makeup</b>: in this spider solitaire, many people need your help. They are very poor or ugly, and need to makeover to be more beautiful or handsome, play classic spider solitaire to help them makeup. You will be their hero!\r\n<b>Beautiful themes</b>: 200+ beautiful backgrounds, 180+ card backs, and 10+ suits of card faces. They are all editor's best choice. And also, tens of special effects for the backgrounds, you can choose your favorite effect for your favorite backgrounds. \r\n<b>Winning animations</b>: many different shape animations for your win of the deals, smooth animations like apple, star, bird, and others will show when you win a spider solitaire deal.\r\n<b>Snow Festival Pass event</b>: play this snow festival pass event in this classic spider solitaire to get more achievement.\r\n<b>Different suits deals</b>: Spider solitaire has 1 suit deal, 2 suits deal, 3 suits deal, and 4 suits deal. The more the suites, the more difficult the deal. You can choose the difficulty that suits you.\r\n<b>Big font</b>: the font of the card is big which makes your eyes particularly comfortable. You can even make the font bigger if you choose to 2 rows of the spider solitaire layout.\r\n<b>Magic wand</b>: when you don't know how to move or you have no useful moves in a spider solitaire deal, you can use magic wand to move a list of A, 2, 3, ..., J, Q, K to the foundation.\r\n<b>Daily challenge</b>: If you are a player like challenges, the daily challenge feature is a good choice. The spider solitaire deals of this feature need more skillful to win. These spider deals are also the best choice to sharp your mind and exercise your brain.\r\n\r\nIf you are a solitaire fans, or you have played solitaire including any of the Klondike solitaire, spider solitaire, TriPeaks solitaire, FreeCell solitaire, pyramid solitaire, spades, or other kinds of classic card games for many years, this spider solitaire is really a better choice for you.\r\n\r\nInstall this amazing spider solitaire! Install it! Install it!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is an amazing classic spider solitaire not only has very smooth basic spider solitaire game play, but also has spider solitaire journey, spider solitaire jigsaw, spider solitaire makeup, and other interesting game play. You can focus on playing the classic spider solitaire card games, and when you need some freshness in classic spider solitaire card games you can play this creative solitaire journey, solitaire jigsaw, solitaire makeup, and so on. Spider Solitaire is also the best classic solitaire card game to sharp your mind and train your brain, like Klondike solitaire, TriPeaks solitaire, Pyramid solitaire, FreeCell solitaire, and so on. Playing Spider Solitaire keeps your brain doing exercise, like your body doing sport, which makes your brain more energetic and younger.<br><br><b>Spider solitaire journey</b>: The journey will bring you to many countries to enjoy the beautiful sceneries. When you play some spider solitaire card games in this solitaire journey, the journey will bring you to a different place with beautiful scenery. You can go to Europe, America, and so on. Each deal of the spider solitaire card games in this solitaire journey feature has a goal, when you finish the goal you win this deal. The spider deals with goals are really interesting.<br><b>Spider solitaire jigsaw</b>: play spider solitaire card games to collect jigsaw fragments, and then you will collect many beautiful pieces and pictures.<br><b>Spider solitaire makeup</b>: in this spider solitaire, many people need your help. They are very poor or ugly, and need to makeover to be more beautiful or handsome, play classic spider solitaire to help them makeup. You will be their hero!<br><b>Beautiful themes</b>: 200+ beautiful backgrounds, 180+ card backs, and 10+ suits of card faces. They are all editor&#39;s best choice. And also, tens of special effects for the backgrounds, you can choose your favorite effect for your favorite backgrounds. <br><b>Winning animations</b>: many different shape animations for your win of the deals, smooth animations like apple, star, bird, and others will show when you win a spider solitaire deal.<br><b>Snow Festival Pass event</b>: play this snow festival pass event in this classic spider solitaire to get more achievement.<br><b>Different suits deals</b>: Spider solitaire has 1 suit deal, 2 suits deal, 3 suits deal, and 4 suits deal. The more the suites, the more difficult the deal. You can choose the difficulty that suits you.<br><b>Big font</b>: the font of the card is big which makes your eyes particularly comfortable. You can even make the font bigger if you choose to 2 rows of the spider solitaire layout.<br><b>Magic wand</b>: when you don&#39;t know how to move or you have no useful moves in a spider solitaire deal, you can use magic wand to move a list of A, 2, 3, ..., J, Q, K to the foundation.<br><b>Daily challenge</b>: If you are a player like challenges, the daily challenge feature is a good choice. The spider solitaire deals of this feature need more skillful to win. These spider deals are also the best choice to sharp your mind and exercise your brain.<br><br>If you are a solitaire fans, or you have played solitaire including any of the Klondike solitaire, spider solitaire, TriPeaks solitaire, FreeCell solitaire, pyramid solitaire, spades, or other kinds of classic card games for many years, this spider solitaire is really a better choice for you.<br><br>Install this amazing spider solitaire! Install it! Install it!",
